  "hero.sub": "Symbiosis ties two things into one organism - a studio that creates videos with AI characters and tracks every click back to the client, and a platform that runs your clients, proposals, projects and finances. Your content knows who watched it. Your system knows what to say next. 100+ AI models and prospect search - without a single extra subscription.",
