  "st.eyebrow": "Why this matters",
  "st.title": "Small businesses lose more money and time than they realize.",
  "st.sub": "Here is what independent research shows about owners who run their sales across dozens of separate tools.",
  "st.s1.unit": "tools",
  "st.s1.body": "The average company pays for 106 software subscriptions. Most are used by a handful of people, but every one shows up on the bill each month.",
  "st.s1.src": "SellersCommerce, 2025",
  "st.s2.unit": "switches / day",
  "st.s2.body": "The average employee switches between tools 1,200 times a day. Each switch costs up to 9.5 minutes to refocus.",
  "st.s2.src": "Harvard Business Review, 2022",
  "st.s3.unit": "time lost",
  "st.s3.body": "Frequent context switching can quietly burn up to 40% of your productive time - almost half of every working day.",
  "st.s3.src": "APA / Atlassian",
  "st.s4.unit": "more deals signed",
  "st.s4.body": "Replying to a new lead within 5 minutes brings 21× more qualified deals than replying after 30 minutes. Most companies reply after 42 hours.",
  "st.s4.src": "Kixie Lead Response Study, 2025",
  "st.s4.label1": "under 5 min",
  "st.s4.label2": "over 30 min",
  "st.s5.unit": "minutes a day",
  "st.s5.body": "Almost an hour of every working day is spent searching for information across separate tools - a doc here, a sheet there, a message in a fourth app.",
  "st.s5.src": "Qatalog / Cornell, 2024",
  "st.s6.unit": "weeks a year",
  "st.s6.body": "The average worker loses 5 weeks a year just to switching between tools. That is 5 weeks your business never gets back.",
  "st.s6.src": "Harvard Business Review / Conclude",
  "st.foot": "None of this is your fault - it is a side effect of tools that do not talk to each other. Symbiosis solves exactly this problem.",
  "day.eyebrow": "A day in your life",
  "day.title": "What a normal day looks like - before and with Symbiosis.",
  "day.sub": "Picture Monday morning. You are a business owner with a team, clients and goals. Here is the difference.",
  "day.before": "Before",
  "day.after": "With Symbiosis",
  "day.t1": "08:30 · Morning",
  "day.t2": "13:00 · Lunch",
  "day.t3": "19:30 · Evening",
  "day.m1.before": "You open 6 different dashboards. You cannot remember which client is waiting on you. You jump from email to CRM to Excel. Half an hour gone before your first coffee.",
  "day.m1.after": "You open one screen. You see the three hottest clients of the day, with a recommended next step for each. You start the most important calls at 09:00.",
  "day.m2.before": "A client urgently needs a proposal. You open 4 windows, stitch it together from notes and an old Word file. You send it 3 hours late. Three other tasks sit waiting.",
  "day.m2.after": "AI builds you a proposal with three pricing options in 14 seconds. You review, sign, send. The client opens it before your coffee gets cold.",
  "day.m3.before": "You head home with the feeling that you do not really know where you stand. Are you profitable this month? Which project makes money, which loses it? You do not know.",
  "day.m3.after": "You open the dashboard from your phone. 30 seconds. You see: +12% revenue this month, 2 proposals signed, 47 hot clients. You close the app and enjoy the evening.",
  "pq.text": "More business. More life.",
  "pq.sub": "Symbiosis is not just software. It is a partner that works while you sleep, so you can do what you started a business for in the first place.",
  "tr.eyebrow": "The transformation",
  "tr.title": "What your business looks like before and after Symbiosis.",
  "tr.sub": "A typical picture for an owner or team in the first 90 days running on Symbiosis.",
  "tr.before.h": "Before",
  "tr.after.h": "After 90 days",
  "tr.before.1a": "€500–€2,000/mo",
  "tr.before.1b": "on 10+ separate subscriptions and AI credits",
  "tr.before.2a": "10–15 hours/wk",
  "tr.before.2b": "lost moving data between tools by hand",
  "tr.before.3a": "2–3 hot clients",
  "tr.before.3b": "missed every week because nobody is following up",
  "tr.before.4a": "40–60% of proposals",
  "tr.before.4b": "go silent - and you do not know why",
  "tr.before.5a": "0 clarity",
  "tr.before.5b": "on which project earns and which client really pays",
  "tr.after.1a": "−60 to −80%",
  "tr.after.1b": "lower spend on software and AI tools",
  "tr.after.2a": "+10 hrs/wk",
  "tr.after.2b": "returned to real work and real growth",
  "tr.after.3a": "2× to 3× more",
  "tr.after.3b": "clients reach a proposal - without hiring a new team",
  "tr.after.4a": "+30 to +50%",
  "tr.after.4b": "higher proposal close rate",
  "tr.after.5a": "Full clarity",
  "tr.after.5b": "every client, project and euro visible in one place",
